M/s Balasore Alloys Limited was granted EC, vide file no.- F. No. J-11011/245/2008-1A II(I) dated 25.08.2008 and expansion of capacity vide file no.- F. No. J-11011/245/2008-1A II(I) dated 07/08.2019 for production of 1.6 MTPA HCFeCr.

Due to market demand and other requirements company has decided to go for production of Low Carbon Ferro Chrome along with the production of existing HCFeCr. Hence it is proposed to add 4 nos. of EAF of capacity 3.8 MVA each for production of LCFeCr. Details of proposal are as under;

3×18 and 2×12 MVA SAF to 4×3.8 EAF, 3×18 and 2×12 MVA SAF and the enhancement in production capacity from 0.16 ΜΤΡΑ (HCFeCr) to 0.198 ΜΤΡΑ (HCFeCr/LCFeCr), shall meet the guide lines of "No Increase in Pollution Load" (NIPL) notification published by MOEF&CC on 2nd March 2021.

